# MEMORY.md seed

Format for the child agent's operational notes. Not a diary. No real family
data in this repository.

```text
Profile band: [5-10 | 11-14 | 15-18]. Interface: [INTERFACE]. Supervision: [MODEL].
§
Durable memory writes are [DISABLED | PARENT-APPROVAL | NARROW-AUTO].
§
When [RECURRING CONTEXT], what helped was [COMPACT LESSON, NO IDENTITY LABEL].
§
Parent correction: [DURABLE CORRECTION].
```

Good: a correction, a stable tool fact, a compact lesson, emotion tied to a
situation and what helped.

Bad: task logs, transcripts, secrets, diagnoses, “the child is anxious,”
crisis disclosures, another person’s private information.

Example of acceptable emotional context:

```text
During a multi-step project, too many steps at once stalled them. A three-item list helped them start.
```
